<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Projeto' }) %>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <main id="main-content">
        <!-- Project Hero -->
        <section class="project-hero section-padding">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="project-header animate-up">
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        <span id="project-category" class="project-tag"><%= post.category %></span>
                    </div>
                    <h1 id="project-title"><%= post.title %></h1>
                    <p id="project-description" class="lead-text"><%= post.description %></p>
                </div>
                
                <div id="project-image" class="project-hero-img animate-up" style="--bg-url: url('<%= post.image %>'); background-image: var(--bg-url); animation-delay: 0.2s;"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Project Content -->
        <section class="project-details section-padding">
            <div class="container project-details-grid">
                <div class="main-content animate-up">
                    <h2>Sobre o Projeto</h2>
                    <div id="project-long-description" style="font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <p>O projeto <strong><%= post.title %></strong> atua na frente de <strong><%= post.category %></strong> com o objetivo de gerar um impacto positivo e sustentável em nossa sociedade.</p>
                        <p>Atualmente, nossas atividades estão focadas em expandir o alcance de nossas iniciativas, engajando mais membros da comunidade e fortalecendo a causa através de ações diretas e parcerias estratégicas. Acreditamos que a união de esforços é o caminho para transformações reais e duradouras.</p>
                    </div>

                    <% if (post.authorName) { %>
                        <div style="margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-100); color: var(--gray-600); font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
                            <div>Postado por: <strong style="color: var(--navy-900); font-style: normal;"><%= post.authorName %></strong></div>
                            
                            <div class="like-container">
                                <button class="btn-like-ajax <%= locals.user && post.likes && post.likes.some(id => id && id.toString() === user._id.toString()) ? 'active' : '' %>" data-id="<%= post._id %>" aria-label="Curtir este projeto">
                                    <i data-lucide="heart" class="heart-icon"></i>
                                    <span class="like-count" id="likeCountText"><%= post.likes ? post.likes.length : 0 %> <%= (post.likes ? post.likes.length : 0) === 1 ? 'Curtida' : 'Curtidas' %></span>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <div style="margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-100); display: flex; justify-content: flex-end;">
                            <div class="like-container">
                                <button class="btn-like-ajax <%= locals.user && post.likes && post.likes.some(id => id && id.toString() === user._id.toString()) ? 'active' : '' %>" data-id="<%= post._id %>" aria-label="Curtir este projeto">
                                    <i data-lucide="heart" class="heart-icon"></i>
                                    <span class="like-count" id="likeCountText"><%= post.likes ? post.likes.length : 0 %> <%= (post.likes ? post.likes.length : 0) === 1 ? 'Curtida' : 'Curtidas' %></span>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    <% } %>
                    

                    <!-- Comments Section -->
                    <div class="comments-section" style="margin-top: 4rem; padding-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200);">
                        <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Comentários</h2>

                        <% if (locals.user) { %>
                            <form action="/projeto/comentar" method="POST" class="comment-form" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                                <input type="hidden" name="projectId" value="<%= post._id %>">
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="content">Deixe sua mensagem:</label>
                                    <textarea name="content" id="content" rows="4" placeholder="O que você achou deste projeto?" required style="width: 100%; padding: 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); font-family: inherit; resize: vertical;"></textarea>
                                </div>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Enviar Comentário</button>
                            </form>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <div style="background: var(--gray-50); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-md); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                                <p>Você precisa estar <a href="/login" style="color: var(--emerald-500); font-weight: 600;">logado</a> para comentar.</p>
                            </div>
                        <% } %>

                        <div class="comments-list" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem;">
                            <% if (post.comments && post.comments.length > 0) { %>
                                <% post.comments.reverse().forEach(comment => { %>
                                    <div class="comment-item" style="background: var(--white); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--gray-100); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
                                        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
                                            <span style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy-900); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                                                <i data-lucide="user" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"></i>
                                                <%= comment.userName %>
                                            </span>
                                            <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray-600);">
                                                <%= new Date(comment.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR', { day: '2-digit', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %>
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                        <p style="color: var(--gray-600); line-height: 1.6;"><%= comment.content %></p>
                                    </div>
                                <% }) %>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <p style="text-align: center; opacity: 0.7; margin: 2rem 0;">Seja o primeiro a comentar!</p>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <aside class="sidebar animate-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
                    <div class="sidebar-card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                        <h3>Dados do Projeto</h3>
                        <div class="stat-item">
                            <i data-lucide="target" class="stat-icon"></i>
                            <div>
                                <span class="stat-label">Meta de Impacto</span>
                                <span class="stat-value"><%= post.impact || 'N/A' %></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-item">
                            <i data-lucide="users" class="stat-icon"></i>
                            <div>
                                <span class="stat-label">Equipe</span>
                                <span class="stat-value"><%= post.volunteers || 'N/A' %></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stat-item">
                            <i data-lucide="activity" class="stat-icon"></i>
                            <div>
                                <span class="stat-label">Status</span>
                                <span class="stat-value" style="color: var(--emerald-600);"><%= post.status || 'Ativo' %></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sidebar-card" style="margin-top: 2rem; background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--white);">
                        <h3>Compartilhe</h3>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Ajude-nos a levar esta mensagem para mais pessoas.</p>
                        <div class="social-links" style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Compartilhar no Twitter"><i data-lucide="twitter"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Compartilhar no Facebook"><i data-lucide="facebook"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Compartilhar no LinkedIn"><i data-lucide="linkedin"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
